---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
const faqs = [
  ['Can I call if probate hasn’t started?', 'Yes. You can call to discuss your property and where you are in the process. Probate and the authority to sell will need to be reviewed before a sale can move forward.'],
  ['What if I live outside Florida?', 'We work with people who have inherited property in Miami-Dade, Broward, and Palm Beach Counties, including heirs who live out of state. Start with a phone conversation about the home and what needs to happen next.'],
  ['Do I have to repair or empty the house?', 'We consider direct purchases of homes as-is, including homes that need repairs or still contain belongings. We’ll discuss the condition and any cleanout needs when reviewing the property.'],
  ['How does paying probate costs work?', 'After reviewing your situation, we can discuss whether an arrangement to cover probate-related costs is available. The scope, conditions, and any purchase rights must be set out in a written agreement. Our existing approach asks for the first right to offer and purchase the property; ask us to explain exactly what that means for your situation.'],
  ['How soon can the property sell?', 'Timing depends on the estate, title, required approvals, and paperwork. Once the legal requirements are satisfied, we can discuss a closing date that works for you. A probate timeline cannot be guaranteed.'],
  ['Does calling commit me to selling?', 'No. The initial phone consultation is free and carries no obligation to sell. Any future arrangement or purchase would require your review and a written agreement.'],
];
---
<Layout title="Inherited a Home in South Florida? | We Pay Probate" description="Discuss your inherited home in Miami-Dade, Broward, or Palm Beach County. Explore probate-related property help and an as-is sale. Call 954-320-6336.">
  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero wrap">
      <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> SOUTH FLORIDA · INHERITED PROPERTY HELP</p><h1>A home inherited.<br />A lot to navigate.<br /><em>A way forward.</em></h1><p class="intro">You don’t have to figure out the property side of probate alone. Let’s talk through your situation, the home, and your next steps.</p><a class="button" href={site.phoneHref} data-call-location="hero">Let’s talk about your property <span>↗</span></a><p class="micro">Free phone consultation. No obligation to sell.</p></div>
      <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Illustration of a South Florida home"><div class="art-top"><span>A NEW CHAPTER STARTS HERE</span><span>01 / FL</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 560 420" role="img" aria-label="A welcoming home beneath the South Florida sun"><circle cx="405" cy="96" r="57" fill="#edb68c"/><path d="M0 330Q150 280 300 322T560 300V420H0Z" fill="#c9d4bf"/><path d="M0 373Q200 330 560 360V420H0Z" fill="#a8bca5"/><path d="M102 228L273 113L448 228Z" fill="#234f48"/><path d="M126 220H423V354H126Z" fill="#f5eee0"/><path d="M110 227L273 118L436 227" fill="none" stroke="#173e39" stroke-width="14" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M250 265H305V354H250Z" fill="#c07854"/><circle cx="294" cy="310" r="3" fill="#f5eee0"/><g fill="#94b3b0" stroke="#234f48" stroke-width="7"><path d="M158 261H215V307H158Z"/><path d="M339 261H396V307H339Z"/></g><path d="M187 261V307M367 261V307" stroke="#234f48" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M261 355L219 420H351L297 355" fill="#e7d2b5"/><path d="M66 360Q87 250 65 147" fill="none" stroke="#716e4d" stroke-width="11"/><g fill="#446a4e"><path d="M67 159Q5 91 3 175Q26 145 67 159Z"/><path d="M67 159Q68 62 127 94Q81 111 67 159Z"/><path d="M67 159Q130 107 151 168Q107 143 67 159Z"/><path d="M67 159Q27 104 21 110Q26 77 67 159Z"/></g><g fill="#668260"><ellipse cx="414" cy="351" rx="41" ry="18"/><ellipse cx="145" cy="352" rx="39" ry="17"/></g></svg><div class="art-note"><span class="note-icon">↗</span><div>A property. A family. A fresh start.<small>Local help, wherever you call home.</small></div></div></div>
    </section>
    <div class="service-strip"><div class="wrap"><span>HERE FOR YOU IN</span><strong>Miami-Dade County</strong><span class="separator">✳</span><strong>Broward County</strong><span class="separator">✳</span><strong>Palm Beach County</strong></div></div>
    <section id="your-options" class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">LESS ON YOUR SHOULDERS</p><h2>The house comes with questions.<br />Let’s work through them.</h2><p>An inherited home can mean repairs, belongings, estate paperwork, and decisions you weren’t expecting. Start with one conversation.</p></div><div class="cards"><article class="card"><span class="card-number">01 / THE PROCESS</span><div class="card-icon">↗</div><h3>Probate-related property help</h3><p>Have a home you can’t sell because of estate or legal issues? We’ll discuss the obstacles and whether help with probate-related costs may be available.</p><a href="#questions">Understand the arrangement ↗</a></article><article class="card"><span class="card-number">02 / THE PROPERTY</span><div class="card-icon">⌂</div><h3>Sell the home as-is</h3><p>Explore a direct purchase without taking on renovations. We consider homes needing repairs, updates, or help clearing out belongings.</p><a href={site.phoneHref} data-call-location="as-is-card">Discuss your home ↗</a></article><article class="card"><span class="card-number">03 / THE DISTANCE</span><div class="card-icon">◎</div><h3>Live elsewhere? Start here.</h3><p>You may be hundreds of miles away while the house is in South Florida. Tell us what’s happening and we’ll discuss the next steps for the property.</p><a href="#out-of-state">Help for out-of-state heirs ↗</a></article></div></section>
    <section id="how-it-works" class="process section"><div class="wrap process-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">A SIMPLE PLACE TO START</p><h2>One call.<br />More clarity.</h2><p>You don’t need to have every answer before you reach out.</p><a class="text-link" href={site.phoneHref} data-call-location="process">Call {site.phone} ↗</a></div><ol class="steps"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Tell us your situation</h3><p>Where is the home? Has probate started? What feels most difficult right now? We’ll listen.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Explore a path for the property</h3><p>We review the home and estate-related obstacles, then explain any proposed assistance and purchase terms.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Decide with a clear understanding</h3><p>Review the written terms and get the advice you need. A sale moves forward only when the necessary legal requirements are satisfied.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
    <section id="out-of-state" class="section wrap remote"><div class="remote-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="remote-label">NEAR OR FAR. STILL FAMILY.</span><div class="orbit"><span>FL</span><i class="orbit-point"></i></div><p>South Florida property.<br />Support from wherever you are.</p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">FOR OUT-OF-STATE HEIRS</p><h2>Your life is there.<br />The house is here.</h2><p>Managing a parent’s home from another state can feel overwhelming. A first conversation can help you understand the property-related decisions ahead.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Homes in Miami-Dade, Broward, and Palm Beach</li><li>Start by phone, wherever you live</li><li>Discuss repairs, belongings, and an as-is purchase</li><li>Understand proposed terms before deciding</li></ul><a class="button" href={site.phoneHref} data-call-location="out-of-state">Talk through your next steps <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
    <section id="questions" class="section wrap faq"><div><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE MORE CLARITY</p><h2>Questions you<br />might be carrying.</h2><p>Something else on your mind?<br /><a class="text-link" href={site.phoneHref} data-call-location="faq">We’re a phone call away ↗</a></p></div><div>{faqs.map(([question, answer]) => <details><summary>{question}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}</div></section>
    <section class="closing"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">YOU DON’T NEED TO HAVE IT ALL FIGURED OUT</p><h2>Let’s find your<br /><em>next step.</em></h2><p>Tell us about the home. We’ll take it from there, together.</p><a class="button light" href={site.phoneHref} data-call-location="closing">Call {site.phone}<span>↗</span></a><p class="micro">Free phone consultation · No obligation to sell</p></div></section>
  </main>
</Layout>
